[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4860.39, "timestamp": "01:21:00", "text": "很快。很快。我最近玩得更多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4863.669, "timestamp": "01:21:03", "text": "不过是Warframe。嗯。最近一直在玩游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4865.669, "timestamp": "01:21:05", "text": "Warframe。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4869.03, "timestamp": "01:21:09", "text": "哦，Warframe。哦，你玩Warframe？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4871.669, "timestamp": "01:21:11", "text": "是的。如何？它比……更好吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4874.79, "timestamp": "01:21:14", "text": "Destiny 还是和 Destiny 一样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4876.31, "timestamp": "01:21:16", "text": "我认为将它们进行比较是不公平的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4878.75, "timestamp": "01:21:18", "text": "因为他们是两个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4881.43, "timestamp": "01:21:21", "text": "不一样，你知道的。是的，你说得对。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4883.189, "timestamp": "01:21:23", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4884.55, "timestamp": "01:21:24", "text": "这就像试图比较《我的世界》一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4894.39, "timestamp": "01:21:34", "text": "是的。呃，但我认为战争相当"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4897.59, "timestamp": "01:21:37", "text": "我觉得如果你愿意的话，会很有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4902.39, "timestamp": "01:21:42", "text": "等三天左右就能造出一把枪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4905.189, "timestamp": "01:21:45", "text": "你可以制作枪支。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4906.87, "timestamp": "01:21:46", "text": "是的，你可以打造武器。我是说，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4908.75, "timestamp": "01:21:48", "text": "你获得的大部分武器都是手工制作的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4911.43, "timestamp": "01:21:51", "text": "制作，但当你制作一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4914.669, "timestamp": "01:21:54", "text": "武器，在你拿到它之前会有一个计时器。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4918.149, "timestamp": "01:21:58", "text": "完成的。呃，通常是12个小时左右。"}]